22 01-checked-tix-to-cuda-lowering.md 80 ## Checked pass and reuse  Use a versioned `defineTransformation` from the existing Tix IR contract type plus selected function to a typed CUDA source artifact. Its body calls the same emitter as `cudaSource`. Its `ensures` invariant is `differential` with asynchronous `decide`. `AnalysisManager.execute` waits for the invariant before accepting the output. The body uses `cache: 'never'`. `checkLowering` surfaces the first numerical counterexample or the execution failure. 
